# DouyinLiveRecorder Project Structure Guide

## Core Components

### Main Entry Point
- [main.py](mdc:main.py) - Primary application entry point for live streaming recording
- [post_process.py](mdc:post_process.py) - Post-processing pipeline for recorded videos

### Configuration Management
- [config_reader.py](mdc:config_reader.py) - Centralized configuration reader with BOM character handling
- [config/config.ini](mdc:config/config.ini) - Main configuration file (uses utf-8-sig encoding)
- [config_manager.py](mdc:config_manager.py) - Configuration management utilities

### Core Services
- [api_client.py](mdc:api_client.py) - API integration for notifications and token management
- [src/logger.py](mdc:src/logger.py) - Enhanced logging system with status log separation
- [msg_push.py](mdc:msg_push.py) - Message pushing and notification services

### Key Directories
- `src/` - Core source code modules
- `config/` - Configuration files and templates
- `logs/` - Application and status logs (auto-rotated)
- `downloads/` - Downloaded live stream files
- `i18n/` - Internationalization files

## Important Files
- [requirements.txt](mdc:requirements.txt) - Python dependencies
- [Dockerfile](mdc:Dockerfile) - Container configuration
- [docker-compose.yaml](mdc:docker-compose.yaml) - Multi-container setup
